xml/ - SAX / Expat demos (Python 2.7)
====================================

Need a working pyexpat (bundled in this AmigaPython build).

  elem_count.py   Count elements and attributes
  roundtrip.py    Parse and write back XML
  rss2html.py     Convert an RSS XML file to HTML

Usage:

  Python elem_count.py some.xml
  Python roundtrip.py some.xml
  Python rss2html.py feed.xml >ram:out.html
